=== M3 variants: production kernel vs (i) constants in place of the lookup, (ii) float tables with linear interpolation; N = 65536 at Gamma_p0 = 3, lambda = 0.05, 20 warm-up and 100 timed launches, medians; MATCHED WORK (the ion state restored and the RNG pool re-seeded before every launch, identically for every kernel) ===
